(5) PRODUCT CASE DOES NOT EXIST YET — product_realist correctly notes: self-confidence is free, monitor adds complexity, 42% coverage is below bar, 30% flag-rate implies high FP cost. No product path without L1 showing the confidence-flip on real traces.

